A PDF brief arrives. &ldquo;Our legal team needs us to start immediately. To avoid platform fees we will transfer $4,000 straight to your bank today - just send us full administrative access to your development server now.&rdquo;
 What do you do? A: Grant the server access. He seems legitimate and the payment is coming direct. B: No administrative access until there is a signed contract with escrow on a recognised platform. Key takeaway
 A detailed brief and large retainer do not establish trust. Verify the identity, agree the contract and payment process, and limit access before work begins.
